# Local environment secrets
.env.local
.env

# Windows clipboard/IDE scratch files
~ClipboardTransferring.tmp
~$*

# Signing material. The named entries above (key.jks, key_base64.txt) only ever
# covered the one filename this project happened to use; a keystore checked in
# under any other name went straight past them. These match by kind instead.
*.jks
*.keystore
*.p12
*keystore*base64*
*key*base64*

# Screenshots and capture material. These are shot on a real device against a
# real account, so they carry contact names, photos and message text that have
# nothing to do with the code. Kept on disk - the liquid-glass calibration
# references live here and the handoff measures against them - but never
# committed. See HANDOFF_LIQUID_GLASS.md.
demo/
